OL,10,G1850 Witness History
OL,11,     FIn 1944, a weather report
OL,12,     Fpredicted a storm that changed the
OL,13,     Fcourse of WW2 history. The
OL,14,     Fforecast was the first indication
OL,15,     Fof bad weather and led the Allies
OL,16,     Fto delay D-Day.
